WEBVTT

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.240
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.140
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:22.950
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.400
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.650
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:40.000
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.410
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.620
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.730
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:54.510
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:58.350
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:02.760
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:08.110
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:10.960
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:15.210
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:18.280
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:23.190
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:25.960
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:30.220
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:34.490
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.110
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:37.950
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.840
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.710
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.020
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.810
And now, it's magic time!

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:52.200
Your consciousness is separating from your body.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:56.330
You can hear only my voice.

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.970
You can hear <i>only</i> my voice.

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:03.090
Magical Boy Zero

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.040
It's Zero!

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.900
Zero's show is on!

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:07.060
He's so neat!

00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:08.320
Amashing! { As usual with Ami, misspellings are intentional }

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:10.140
Hypmotism is amashing!

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.300
This is stupid. It's totally fake.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:15.340
You know you actually believe in it.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.240
One, two, three.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:26.110
Utau-san is now completely under the effects of hypnotism.

00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.170
Now...

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:38.540
Do not be alarmed!

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:45.070
The instant Utau-san falls into this cage, I will transform her into a thousand butterflies with my magic!

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.980
It's magic time!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:53.070
It's Zero Time!

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:01.810
Cut!

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:06.030
We'll do the rest of the scene where Utau-chan turns into butterflies in CG and combine it.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.780
Thank you very much!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.840
This is stupid.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:14.790
Make the CG a lot flashier than last time.

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:15.920
But...

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:18.500
I'm only telling you what the audience wants.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.130
You just need to follow my instructions.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.490
But...

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.830
I can see them! I can see them!

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.190
I can see the star's guardian spirits!

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:28.950
Sensei! We have to go to your next appointment! {I know he says "job"}

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:33.040
If you go on a date with me, I'll invite you onto my show!

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.040
Thank you very much!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:39.210
If you appear on her show, your popularity will skyrocket!

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:42.080
What's with that defiant look?

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.980
"Magic time?"

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:49.940
Your tricks are all CG. You're nothing but a fake.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:53.070
What did you say? Where's your manager?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.960
Has Utau done something wrong?

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.490
What kind of manners have you taught your client?

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.880
What's the problem?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:04.390
Utau's popularity will soon surpass Zero-kun's.

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:07.790
What? She's just some rookie idol!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.920
The entertainment world is the worst.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:10.640
But Utau's vocal talent is real.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:13.340
I was looking forward to seeing you do magic firsthand, is all.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:15.860
She should stick to singing, and you should do some proper managing!

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.270
So I'm disappointed.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:33.080
One, Two, Three! Heart Magic!

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:33.080
Episode 16

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.510
Man, this just sucks.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:02.440
I was so worried about Nikaidou-sensei that I totally couldn't concentrate on the test!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.920
Isn't it because you watched TV last night?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.750
In other words, it's an excuse.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:14.490
Amu-chan, shouldn't you tell the others about Nikaidou-sensei?

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:15.620
Yeah.

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.510
I need to talk to you guys about something.

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.460
Z-Z-Z-Z-

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.500
Shh!

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.930
Calm down, Hinamori! I'll explain!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:35.000
I'm Nagakura Takuya, from the fourth-grade Star Class.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:37.620
I can't believe Zero goes to our school.

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:45.430
Since Zero is supposed to be my mysterious secret identity, the only person here who knows is the Chairman.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.520
Should you be telling us?

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:52.400
Takuya-kun trusts the Guardians, so he revealed his identity to us.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.690
He says he'd like to show us some magic.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.690
What? Why?

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:57.850
Who cares?

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.510
We get to see Zero's magic in person!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.360
I got his autograph, too!

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.690
We're the only ones who know his true identity!

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.910
Aren't you overreacting?

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:08.820
It's not cool to ask a star for their autograph.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.270
Then again, Ami's a huge fan...

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.690
And Amu-chi's stubbornness makes an appearance!

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.750
She's doing just what I thought she would.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:23.710
Maybe we really should hear the reason why.

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.550
What?

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.790
Takuya-kun, isn't there something you want to tell us?

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.010
Actually...

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.300
What? Zero's magic is fake?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.530
That's harsh!

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.470
You mean, even your trick yesterday with the lion?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:47.670
Yes. They stopped the cameras before she fell in the cage, and then added CG in later.

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.230
Damn.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.540
I totally screwed up on my test today because of you.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.930
That's the same excuse Amu-chan used.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:06:58.800
Shut up!

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:01.620
I'm totally shocked! I don't want your autograph!

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.350
Yaya-chan, that's rude.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:07.790
Why should I act happy about getting a fake magician's autograph?

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:12.820
So you want to perform real magic for us because you regret deceiving people?

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:13.820
No.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:14.820
Huh?

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:25.310
When I first debuted, my magic was real.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.810
But as my popularity increased and I got more jobs...

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:33.390
What the audience wants to see isn't magic.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.260
They want a flashy show!

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:39.660
I wasn't allowed to do magic on stage anymore.

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:43.690
And if I did it for my friends, they'd figure out I was Zero.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:48.770
All I want is to see the happy faces of people who enjoy my magic.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:50.950
So that's why you came to us.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.100
Yes.

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:54.390
Sorry! I said too much. I apologize.

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:55.840
You should apologize, too.

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:59.380
What? I'm not gonna apologize...

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:00.900
That's pretty low.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:05.930
But, but... If he hates being a fake so much, he should just quit being Zero!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.210
That's true.

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:13.600
But it's always been my dream to become a famous magician.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:18.820
Why am I hurting so much, even though my dream's come true?

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:32.070
It's not like having your dream come true is the end of it all.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:38.270
I guess we'll have to let him come to the Royal Garden sometimes to perform magic, to relieve some stress.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.590
Good idea.

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:40.520
No.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.320
I can't accept this.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:48.800
Sneaking around just to let off steam is almost like deceiving your heart's egg.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.700
There has to be something else we can do.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.110
Like what?

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.290
What should we do?

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.030
I don't know!

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:00.950
Let's ask Nadeshiko.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.130
This is really unlike Amu-chan.

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:11.110
She's worried about someone else's egg.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.600
Amu-chan, you're cool! Super cool!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:17.520
Gwardian Characters!

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.560
H-Help us, Amu-chan!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.870
Secret Notebook {09:26, 09:31}

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:39.700
There, we're all set.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.600
Is it really okay for me to use this?

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:45.580
It's fine. It's just a kimono I wore when I was younger.

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:48.250
Well then, let's begin!

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:49.010
Yeah!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.460
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.180
Amu-chan, you're lovely.

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.500
It's like you're the magician.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:07.310
Well, I did the design.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:16.770
The Magician of Light: Shining Zero!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:30.590
Hey, are you going to the secret underground event after school?

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:31.630
Of course!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.260
The Guardians are putting it on, after all.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:39.450
{10:33,10:37} Guardian-Sponsored

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:39.450
1 Day Only Secret Underground Event!

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:39.450
Today after school in the courtyard!!

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.980
I'd never miss it!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.900
I wonder what it's going to be about.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.380
I can't wait!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:39.400
Yeah!

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.990
Don't you think it's about time?

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:53.030
Yeah.

00:10:55.600 --> 00:11:01.110
I'd like to thank you all for coming today, despite the short notice.

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.900
We'll now begin the Guardian-sponsored-

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.190
Hey there!

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:07.910
Of course you've all heard of Zero the boy magician, right?

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:09.720
Of course!

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:14.180
Keep this between us, but Zero has a rival nobody knows about!

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.820
What?

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:17.800
No way! Really? I hadn't heard that!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.570
If you don't think it's true, look up there!

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:24.760
What? Who is that? Look!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.310
That's Zero! But he looks different.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.740
He vanished! Where'd he go?

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:36.990
My name is Shining Zero!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.140
I am the Magician of Light!

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.450
Phew, the diversion worked.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.340
It went well, Amu-chan.

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.350
Yeah.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:54.450
Divert the audience's attention and then do something while they're not looking.

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.320
It's one of the basics of magic.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.250
You can do it, Takuya-kun.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.790
Thank you, Hinamori-senpai.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.850
Shining Zero...

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:09.410
I get it, I just have to disguise myself as someone other than Zero!

00:12:09.480 --> 00:12:13.990
That way, you can perform magic for everyone to your heart's content.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:16.520
That's great! I knew the Guardians would come up with something!

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:19.440
Tadase thought of it.

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:23.110
Hey! No spoilers!

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:29.600
I thought of using a disguise, but Hinamori-san was the one who proposed the original plan.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.530
What?

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:31.820
Oh, it's...

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:01.220
Thank you, Hinamori-senpai!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:05.340
I'm going to really enjoy this character, even if it's only for a day!

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:21.000
Yay! Do you all have the sparkling love magic in your hearts? {This sounds dirty or religious or both}

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:23.320
Yeah!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:27.250
This has been Shining Zero and the Guardians! Thank you!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.400
Did Amu-chi Character Change?

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:31.380
I-It looks like it.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:37.500
Cheers!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:40.470
That was awesome! I'm pumped!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.580
There's someone here who's not excited, though.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.910
I did it again...

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.380
I figured if I did a Character Change I wouldn't be nervous.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:54.100
But what the heck's "sparkling love magic?"

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:57.660
Takuya-kun, did you enjoy yourself?

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:02.060
Very much! I feel as though I heard his voice for the first time in a while, too.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:03.120
"His" voice?

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:07.200
Yes, the voice of my friend Zero.

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:12.260
What'll I do if I fail?

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:17.180
You'll be fine! Didn't you practice really hard?

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.210
But still...

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:20.800
Takuya-kun, smile! Smile!

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:24.440
It's the stage you've always dreamed of! Enjoy it as much as you can!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.130
Right!

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:32.430
I used to have an imaginary friend.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:38.300
I took my stage name, Zero, from him.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.170
It was a Guardian Character.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.320
Yeah.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:48.070
Maybe he came to dislike me because I still wasn't happy even after my dream came true.

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.630
Because before I knew it, I couldn't see Zero anymore.

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:57.680
Maybe he can't see his Guardian Character anymore because he lost sight of who he wants to be.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:01.530
But today, I felt like I could hear his voice.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:03.540
He was saying, "Smile! Smile!"

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.710
Look at that!

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.180
Huh? Oh!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.270
A Guardian Egg.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.530
Shh!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:18.480
Takuya-kun.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:19.480
Yes?

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.220
You'll definitely be able to see Zero again.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:22.880
Yes!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:45.500
An X Character born from a gifted child should be a little different from one from a junk egg.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:50.410
{15:48} Nagakura Takuya

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:50.410
Fourth-Grade Star Class

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:50.410
Professional Magician

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:50.410
Professional activities are to be kept secret at the request of his parents.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:49.000
You're going to provide data for my research.

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:56.620
I hope Takuya-kun gets to see his Guardian Character soon.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:57.610
Yeah.

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:02.640
Ah, such an elegant sweetness.

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:05.720
I used fresh Hokkaido cream.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.760
Ah!

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.940
W-W-W-What's wrong?

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:15.040
I forgot to tell you guys about Hokkaido-sensei, I mean, Nikaidou-sensei!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.070
Oh!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.810
What are you talking about?

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.430
Actually...

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:23.610
Sensei...

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:30.310
Hi, Takuya-kun. The Chairman asked me to escort you to the recording studio.

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:32.520
He did?

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.730
Come now, get in.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.240
O-Okay.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:39.800
You saw Nikaidou-sensei come out of the cabin?

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.060
I didn't see him all that clearly...

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:49.600
Wait. Now that I think about it, Nikaidou-sensei was at Hoshina Utau's concert and on the snowboarding trip.

00:16:49.680 --> 00:16:50.610
Oh!

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.150
That's not all.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:59.620
The outbreak of X Eggs and X Characters coincides perfectly with when Nikaidou-sensei began working here.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:03.610
Hey, Takuya-kun isn't going to be in danger or anything, is he?

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.750
Zero's Dressing Room

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:15.990
Huh? W-What did you say?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:17.690
I said you're fired.

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:19.080
Why?!

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:23.030
Now that we use CG, anyone can be the magician.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:26.230
It doesn't matter if they can't do real magic.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:33.900
So I've decided to use a child who's less rebellious, who'll obey me, as the second-generation Zero.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.150
That's pretty harsh.

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:45.880
Nikaidou-sensei.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:51.950
You poor thing, your dream of being a famous magician is all over now.

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.970
My dream...

00:17:57.270 --> 00:18:00.960
How fortunate for me. I won't even have to push him.

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.330
My dream isn't over!

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.870
I'll go to America!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:09.620
I'll start practicing again in Las Vegas, the best place for magic!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.490
H-Hold on there. Las Vegas?

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:13.390
Do you even know English?

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.980
I'll start studying it now!

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.030
Isn't that a tad impossible?

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:19.380
"Smile! Smile!"

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:22.150
If I just do that, I know I'll see Zero again.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.270
Hinamori-senpai even said so.

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:27.670
He's unexpectedly stubborn.

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:28.600
What?

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:36.540
About that, I'm actually the one who asked Hinamori-san and the others to help you out.

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:37.550
What?

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:43.610
Your manager was really after me to let you get rid of some stress somehow.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:46.230
Let me through!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.650
No. This area is for authorized personnel only.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:49.800
Please!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.010
If you don't, Takuya-kun will...

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:57.560
They didn't feel like doing it at first. They said magic was dumb.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.140
No...

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:03.230
But when I offered to give them extra marks on their tests, they willingly agreed.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.810
That's not true.

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:13.180
Please let us through!

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.940
You can't!  {etc. I think one is enough...}

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:16.120
Nikaidou-sensei?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.950
Hello, Hinamori Amu-san.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.410
Where's Takuya-kun?

00:19:19.460 --> 00:19:21.490
Beats me. I have no idea.

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:22.380
Hey!

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:23.580
Wait!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:27.420
Are you the one who's been making the X Eggs?

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:32.870
Stop right there!

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:33.950
Go, Hinamori!

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:35.540
Take care of Takuya-kun!

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:40.460
W-What happened?

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.290
I don't know! Run!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.450
What's happening?

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.060
Oh! Amu-chan, look!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.840
It's X Time!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:51.990
An X Character?

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:53.610
Takuya-kun!

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:56.830
Black Magic!

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.000
Why did Takuya-kun's egg do this?

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.000
Everyone just wants to see a flashy show!

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:07.900
They don't want to see boring stuff like magic!

00:20:07.950 --> 00:20:11.840
As if! If that were true, then what caused those smiles the other day?

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.620
Everyone was smiling!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.280
So were you!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:21.800
Making everyone smile so brightly gave you a great smile as well!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:25.790
Your magic is the real thing! It's genuine magic!

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:26.780
Amu-chan!

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:27.430
Right!

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:32.320
My heart: Unlock!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.520
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:50.910
Amu-chan, quick, before anyone comes!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:51.840
I know.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:54.170
Black Magic!

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.020
Magic!

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:56.240
Magic!

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.130
Magic!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:58.940
Now it's my turn!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:01.690
Colorful Canvas!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:06.310
S-Surprise!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:12.710
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.870
Open Heart!

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:34.100
Thank you, Amu-chan.

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.580
Thank goodness.

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:40.650
Takuya-kun.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:41.920
Are you okay?

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.740
Huh? I...

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:50.700
It's been a while, Takuya-kun. Smile! Smile!

00:21:51.730 --> 00:21:52.910
Zero!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.910
Thank goodness!

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:00.770
The one who turned Takuya-kun's egg into an X Egg...

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.000
It has to be...

00:22:05.200 --> 00:22:08.100
I got exactly the data I expected.

00:22:08.240 --> 00:22:11.050
Thanks, Takuya-kun.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:41.390
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.390 --> 00:22:44.160
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:47.630
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:52.360
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.360 --> 00:22:55.040
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:58.680
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:04.870
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:08.990
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:12.420
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.420 --> 00:23:17.580
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:23.510
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:28.760
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:37.630
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:52.580
I knew it! I thought it was super suspicious!

00:23:52.640 --> 00:23:53.440
What? What?

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:54.650
Zero's magic tricks?

00:23:54.680 --> 00:23:57.470
How long you spend in the bathroom?

00:23:57.500 --> 00:24:00.190
No! I'm talking about Nikaidou-sensei's true character!

00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:03.080
Really? But I'm such a nice guy.

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:06.760
There he is! Haven't all the X Eggs been your fault?

00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:09.300
You're thinking too much, Himamori-san. {Misspelling intentional}

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:10.830
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:12.630
Close Call at the Speech Contest!

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:14.050
Tadase and I have a big fight!

00:24:14.110 --> 00:24:15.730
The Guardians might break up! {XXX See if this is really the bunretsu in ep 17}

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:16.480
No way!

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:19.310
What will you do, Himamori-san?

00:24:19.660 --> 00:24:24.370
Tune In Next Time!
